### Upload Image File
POST {{host}}/file/image-upload
Authorization: {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="20220906_094414.jpg"

< /Users/tobilobaowolabi/Documents/pictures/20220906_094414.jpg
--WebAppBoundary


### Upload Document File
POST {{host}}/file/document-upload
Authorization: {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="Tobiloba_Owolabi_Resume_Two.pdf"

< /Users/tobilobaowolabi/Documents/Professional/Resume/Tobiloba_Owolabi_Resume_Two.pdf
--WebAppBoundary


### Delete a file
DELETE {{host}}/file/delete
Authorization: {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

